{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685430/extras/f360024c422ac3bbca465bc07df5cef1.avif?t=1593729422\" width=600 height=177 /></span><br><br>Once upon a time a paradise land was visited by evil beings who kidnapped one of the friends. To save the friend, Crabby and Octopus are setting off for a journey full of dangers.<br><br>You can explore this fabulous adventure by yourself, navigating the naughty Crabby, or with the use of the \u201dcommon screen\u201d mode you can be accompanied by Octopus, navigated by your girlfriend, mate or a member of your family.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685430/extras/524b6f2eb7f249a434bda6a79c7a5c2a.poster.avif?t=1593729422\" width=520 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685430/extras/524b6f2eb7f249a434bda6a79c7a5c2a.webm?t=1593729422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685430/extras/524b6f2eb7f249a434bda6a79c7a5c2a.mp4?t=1593729422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Each adventure consists of two stages. While in the first part you will struggle with villains who are trying to prevent you from finding the scattered diamonds, in the second you have to cover a route full of pitfalls in the shortest time possible. Each land is unique and requires different skills. <br>The characters have different personalities and playing particular heros renders different sensations.<br>Join the exploration of adventures and surprises in the game Run Crabby Run. Solve the mystery of the friend\u2019s kidnapping.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685430/extras/2899e5ac10cf7d04757707fa9c03c558.avif?t=1593729422\" width=600 height=177 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique locations with stunning hand-painted graphic design<br></li><li>An epic journey leading through charming beaches, mysterious woods and plains and blue seas to gloomy ruins of ancient buildings<br></li><li>A possibility of playing solo and in a pair<br></li><li>2 feisty fully animated 3D characters<br></li><li>10 fully animated 3D characters of antagonists<br></li><li>The game is perfect for both occasional and core gamers<br></li><li>A dynamic game with diversified interplay for long evenings</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685430/extras/edc1f0f4d9a0d438e5f1d7d7fa97e079.poster.avif?t=1593729422\" width=500 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685430/extras/edc1f0f4d9a0d438e5f1d7d7fa97e079.webm?t=1593729422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685430/extras/edc1f0f4d9a0d438e5f1d7d7fa97e079.mp4?t=1593729422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/685430?t=1593729422","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1593729422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1593729422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/685430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1593729422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family S